<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Account Deletion Notice — Trendupp</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d9534f 0%, #c0392b 100%);
        padding: 36px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 36px 40px;
      }
      .body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #555;
      }
      .body p strong {
        color: #333;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: #fff5f5;
        border-left: 4px solid #d9534f;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .warning-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #c0392b;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .cta {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 32px 0;
      }
      .cta a {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #5b21b6 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 14px 36px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f9f9fb;
        padding: 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #ebebf0;
      }
      .footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>⚠️ Account Deletion Notice</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= firstName || 'there' %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          We noticed your Trendupp account has been inactive for the past 60 days.
          To keep our platform healthy and avoid billing dormant accounts, we are
          writing to let you know that your account is scheduled for permanent deletion.
        </p>

        <div class="warning-box">
          <p>🗓 Your account will be permanently deleted in <strong>30 days</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you'd like to keep your account, simply log back in to Trendupp before the
          deletion date. Logging in will automatically reactivate your account and cancel
          the scheduled deletion.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you no longer wish to use Trendupp, no action is needed — your account and
          all associated data will be permanently removed after the 30-day window.
        </p>

        <div class="cta">
          <a href="https://trendupp.com/login">Log In to Reactivate My Account</a>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you have any questions, our support team is happy to help at
          <a href="mailto:support@trendupp.com">support@trendupp.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p>— The Trendupp Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          You are receiving this email because your account at
          <strong>trendupp.com</strong> has been inactive for 60 days.<br />
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Trendupp. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
